#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Power Management Engine
#  File: power_management_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS power engine responsible for:
#      • system power states
#      • thermal monitoring & throttling
#      • battery tracking
#      • power policy enforcement
#      • energy telemetry
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Power States](ca://s?q=Explain_Power_States)
#    - [Thermal Control](ca://s?q=Explain_Thermal_Control)
#    - [Battery System](ca://s?q=Explain_Battery_System)
#    - [Power Policies](ca://s?q=Explain_Power_Policies)
#    - [Power Telemetry](ca://s?q=Explain_Power_Telemetry)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - set_state(new_state)
#         Changes system power state.
#
#    - update_thermal(cpu, gpu)
#         Updates thermal readings + throttling.
#
#    - update_battery(level, charging, health)
#         Updates battery metrics.
#
#    - apply_policy(event)
#         Applies power policy event.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns full power engine state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  POWER STATE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "state": "active/idle/sleep/hibernate/shutdown",
#      "thermal": { "cpu_temp": 40.0, "gpu_temp": 38.0, "throttle": false },
#      "battery": { "level": 100, "charging": false, "health": "good" }
#    }
#
